OL,3,GNEWSADog 'grounded' after rescue from
OL,4,Aroof of house
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a dog that was rescued
OL,7,Fafter getting stuck on the roof of
OL,8,Ftheir house said she was "incredibly
OL,9,Fgrateful to those who saved him".
OL,11,FEmma Seager said Sweetie the rescue dog
OL,12,Ffrom Macedonia "likes to get out and
OL,13,Fabout so we have had to modify the
OL,14,Fhouse a lot, but we didn't ever dream
OL,15,Fhe'd be able to open a window and
OL,16,Fscramble up the roof".
OL,18,FHe was rescued on 19 August by Falmouth
OL,19,FCommunity Firefighters who used a 13.5m
OL,20,F(44.3ft) ladder to return him to solid
OL,21,Fground and the family now has to lock
OL,22,Fwindows firmly before going out.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
