OL,3,GNEWSADog 'grounded' after rescue from
OL,4,Aroof of house
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeager said: "He's kept us on our toes
OL,7,Ffor the three years he's been with
OL,8,Fus... we're only too aware it could
OL,9,Fhave had a very different ending."
